                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze, igihe muzogaburisha igihugu ubupfindo, ngo kibabere ishamvu, muze mukūrire Uhoraho umugabane kw ishikanwa, ube umugabane wera ukūwe ku gihugu; uburebure bgawo buze bube irenga ingero ibihumbi mirongwibiri na bitanu, n’amakika yawo abe ibihumbi cumi; uzoba uwera no gushitsa ku mbibe zawo impande zose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.35.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Guh 35:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.42.16+EZK.42.17+EZK.42.18+EZK.42.19+EZK.42.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 42:16-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuri wo muze mukūre ikibanza c’ahēra, uburebure bgaco buze bube irenga ingero amajana atanu, n’amakika yaco abe amajana atanu nyene, mu mpande zose ukw ari zine hangane; kandi habe imparure ihakīkūje ibe iy’ amatambge mirongwitanu y’ukuboko uciriye mu nkokora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.41.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 41:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uru ni rwo rugezo uzogera: uburebure bube irenga ingero ibihumbi mirongwibiri na bitanu, n’amakika abe ibihumbi cumi: aho haze habe ahēra, ari ho hēra cane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.48.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 48:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzoba umugabane wera ukūwe ku gihugu; hazoba ah’ abaherezi, baherereza ahēra, abēgēra Uhoraho ngo bamuhereze; hazoba ah’ amazu yabo, habe n’ ahantu hēra h’ahēra nyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.48.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 48:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalewi baherereza mu ngoro, aho bazohabga, uburebure bgaho buze bube ingero ibihumbi mirongwibiri na bitanu, amakika abe ibihumbi cumi, habe ishamvu yabo, baze bahagire ivyumba vyabo mirongwibiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi muze murobanure ishamvu y’igisagara, iz’ ibe amakika ingero mirongwitanu, uburebure bube ibihumbi mirongwibiri na bitanu, haze habangikane na wa mugabane wera w’ ishikanwa; haze habe ah’ inzu yose ya Isirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.44.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 44:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ ahazoba aha segaba haze habe mu mpande zompi za wa mugabane wera w’ ishikanwa bo n’ishamvu y’igisagara, habangikane n’uwo mugabane wera w’ishikanwa nyene bo n’iyo shamvu y’igisagara, mu ruhande rwerekeye i burengerazuba, no mu ruhande rwerekeye i burasirazuba; uburebure bgaho burehe n’ubg’ umugabane umwe mu yigabanganijwe mu gihugu, uhereye ku rubibe rw’i burengerazuba ugashitsa ku rubibe rw’i burasirazuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
