        },
        {
          "text": "Uku ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize, ati Mu kwezi kwa mbere, ku musi wakwo wa mbere, uze wābīre imasa y’umukangara idafise agasembga; uheze uz’ uhumanure ahēra. ",
