          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ abe ari k’uzohora ugenza nyene, ku musi w’indwi w’ukwezi kwose, ku vyo ugirira uwazimiye wese bo n’imburabgenge: uko ni ko muzotangira ingoro impongano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.20"
            ]
          }
        },
