                  "text": "Lew 23:34-36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kwezi kw’indwi, ku musi wakwo w’icumi na gatanu, mu misi mikuru yakwo, abe ari kw azogenza kumara imisi ndwi; abigenze nk’uko yagenjeje ivy’ ikimazi gitangirwa ivyaha, n’ivy’ ikimazi co kwoswa, n’ivy’ ishikanwa ry’amafu, n’ivy’ amavuta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
